Package: 1bit-kernel-modules-@KVER@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: 1bit <packages@1bit.gg>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: kmod
Description: 1bit OS: kernel modules for @KVER@
 Every module built for @KVER@ - amdgpu, amdxdna and the rest - plus
 the out-of-tree board driver for this machine's embedded controller
 (ec_su_axb35: fans, EC temperature, EC power mode), signed with the
 enrolled MOK so Secure Boot loads it. The driver's source travels
 with it under /usr/src/1bit-ec- (GPL-2.0). No DKMS: the kernel
 version is fixed per release, so these are rebuilt with the kernel,
 not on the box.
